+//    margins, besides vanilla's own rebuild triggers. Otherwise the vanilla path, which also rebuilds once if the
+//    uploaded faces were a filtered subset (or, on the culled path, if the ring buffer was just recreated).
+//  - TerrainStats cloud counters.
+//  - stage 4 (Tessera, -Dmc.shaders=true): the non-OIT cloud passes bind the frame's light block (sun-lit clouds);
+//    the raymarched clouds can be marched at half resolution before the main pass (renderLow) and composited (cloudHalf).
